{
  "tema": 5892,
  "slug": "condicional-poner",
  "titulo": "Conjugate poner in the conditional",
  "subtitulo": "Pondría, pondrías, pondríamos: the future stem pondr- with the conditional endings.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "Poner has the irregular stem pondr- in the conditional, with the regular endings: pondría, pondrías, pondría, pondríamos, pondrían.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Poner** (_to put_) is irregular in the conditional (**el condicional simple**). It uses the same irregular stem as the future, **pondr-**, and the regular conditional endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**pondr-**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "poner"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "pondría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "pondrías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "pondría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "pondríamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "pondrían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on **poner** do the same: **componer** → **compondría**, **proponer** → **propondría**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has a written accent on the **í** of the ending."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **poner** swaps its **e** for a **d**: **pon-d-ría**, like **tendría** and **vendría**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo ==pondría== la música a todo volumen.",
              "en": "I'd put the music on full blast."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú ==pondrías== toda la carne en el asador.",
              "en": "You'd put all the meat on the grill."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi mamá ==pondría== las toallas en el baño.",
              "en": "My mom would put the towels in the bathroom."
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto y yo ==pondríamos== muchas ganas en el proyecto.",
              "en": "Beto and I would put a lot of effort into the project."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las hermanas ==pondrían== las llaves en la mesa.",
              "en": "The sisters would put the keys on the table."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
